# Prefer a Base44 connector for third-party credentials wherever one exists —
# see docs/REPO_SETTINGS.md. Use this file only for values that genuinely
# need to live outside Base44 (e.g. a GitHub Action secret).
#
# Copy to .env.local (or this project's equivalent) and fill in real values.
# Never commit .env, .env.local, or any file containing a real secret.

# Example:
# DATABASE_URL=
# API_KEY=
